I just lost 3 archies in a row tonight.  I went into wizard mode
and yep, you start out unlucky.  Absolutely no praying, nada,
won't work, under any circumstances!  ('course, I didn't survive
long enough to sacrifice a lot or throw gems at unicorns, so
maybe you can help yourself later on).  That bad luck sticks with
you; all my archies were unlucky when they bought it.

Two weird things I noticed:  there were stairs (no, not a mimic, I
went down these stairs) in a shop.  Another time I found a sink
and an altar in the same room.  I don't recall seeing that before.

Also, two of my archies started out with 5 rations instead of
3 or 4, and one got a magic marker, which strikes me as rather odd.

